WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:00.000 --> 00:01.000
MkvDrama.net

3
00:00.780 --> 00:03.400
Is that you, Yamane?

4
00:05.400 --> 00:07.340
Kashiwagi?

5
00:08.246 --> 00:10.466
Yamane, do you work here?

6
00:10.466 --> 00:12.846
Oh, I do...

7
00:14.086 --> 00:15.984
Well...

8
00:15.984 --> 00:18.583
I was transferred here temporarily.

9
00:19.811 --> 00:24.396
So you're the one our parent company sent over, huh?

10
00:24.396 --> 00:25.586
Yeah.

11
00:28.016 --> 00:31.296
Kashiwagi, you haven't changed at all.

12
00:31.296 --> 00:33.306
- Really? - Yeah.

13
00:33.306 --> 00:36.766
Yamane, you've become really beautiful.

14
00:38.346 --> 00:39.776
What?

15
00:40.496 --> 00:41.756
Wow, I'm so happy.

16
00:41.756 --> 00:44.856
Ms. Yamane, the meeting.

17
00:44.856 --> 00:47.536
- Right. - Huh?

18
00:47.536 --> 00:51.056
Are you Taguchi?

19
00:51.056 --> 00:52.586
I'm Kashiwagi.

20
00:52.586 --> 00:55.226
We were in the same class freshman year.

21
00:56.496 --> 00:59.896
Sorry. I don't quite remember.

22
00:59.896 --> 01:01.486
I see.

23
01:01.486 --> 01:05.786
Wow, that's amazing. I can't believe you two work together.

24
01:06.566 --> 01:09.856
I haven't told the company that I know Ms. Yamane.

25
01:09.856 --> 01:12.536
Oh, really?

26
01:12.536 --> 01:15.236
Hey, let's all go out for dinner sometime.

27
01:15.236 --> 01:16.856
If there's time.

28
01:59.926 --> 02:03.926
I'm Kei Kashiwagi, from Restarise Corporation.

29
02:03.926 --> 02:08.336
I've been assigned to join this project starting today.

30
02:08.336 --> 02:11.976
I will do my best. Please take care of me.

31
02:12.686 --> 02:16.106
Okay, everyone, give him a warm welcome.

32
02:17.046 --> 02:18.109
- Ms. Yamane. - Yes?

33
02:18.109 --> 02:20.096
Could you show him around the office?

34
02:20.096 --> 02:21.336
Yes.

35
02:25.036 --> 02:28.696
Nice to see you again, Ms. Yamane.

36
02:28.696 --> 02:30.696
Likewise.

37
02:30.696 --> 02:32.786
Do you know each other?

38
02:32.786 --> 02:36.226
Actually, we were classmates in high school.

39
02:36.226 --> 02:38.786
Wow, that's incredible.

40
02:38.786 --> 02:40.756
I was shocked too.

41
02:41.576 --> 02:44.666
I was surprised as well.

42
02:45.806 --> 02:48.276
So you haven't met since high school?

43
02:48.276 --> 02:49.826
No, we haven't.

44
02:49.826 --> 02:51.576
Yeah.

45
02:57.426 --> 03:03.349
[Can I call you?]

46
03:33.806 --> 03:36.365
[Good night]

47
03:44.278 --> 03:45.848
Ms. Yamane!

48
03:48.966 --> 03:52.896
Are you free now? It's about the committee.

49
03:55.256 --> 03:56.926
Sorry, just a sec.

50
03:58.746 --> 03:59.956
Yes?

51
04:00.906 --> 04:04.806
We're making posters for recommended books tomorrow.

52
04:04.806 --> 04:09.166
If you're free after school, could you help me?

53
04:13.176 --> 04:15.556
Sure, I'm free.

54
04:15.556 --> 04:17.176
Thanks as always.

55
04:19.801 --> 04:22.326
Coffee? That's unusual.

56
04:22.326 --> 04:24.816
Well, I accidentally ordered an extra...

57
04:24.816 --> 04:27.046
I'll take it. How much?

58
04:27.046 --> 04:28.966
Oh no, it's fine.

59
04:28.966 --> 04:30.186
Here.

60
04:33.523 --> 04:34.983
Thank you.

61
04:42.376 --> 04:45.676
So, is that all?

62
04:47.246 --> 04:48.486
Yeah.

63
04:49.726 --> 04:51.226
Bye, then.

64
04:52.526 --> 04:54.136
Taguchi.

65
04:56.916 --> 04:59.366
Hey, thanks for this.

66
05:00.298 --> 05:01.558
Sure.

67
05:04.436 --> 05:06.706
Are you two close?

68
05:06.706 --> 05:07.916
Huh?

69
05:12.216 --> 05:13.696
Never mind.

70
05:50.326 --> 05:52.216
- Ms. Yamane. - Yes?

71
05:52.216 --> 05:56.536
When should we start developing for the field test?

72
05:56.536 --> 05:59.416
Well, first we need to coordinate with the school,

73
05:59.416 --> 06:05.236
sort out the required tasks, and execute them, so...

74
06:07.926 --> 06:10.106
Should we hold off for now?

75
06:10.106 --> 06:13.286
Sorry, just a second.

76
06:13.286 --> 06:15.746
That's fine.

77
06:15.746 --> 06:20.126
We'll talk to the school about making the manual and training, okay?

78
06:20.126 --> 06:22.136
Understood. Thank you.

79
06:22.136 --> 06:23.956
Let us know if you have questions.

80
06:23.956 --> 06:25.466
Okay.

81
06:25.466 --> 06:26.688
Sorry.

82
06:27.596 --> 06:28.806
Thank you.

83
06:28.806 --> 06:30.136
No problem.

84
06:34.626 --> 06:37.196
- You're impressive, Kashiwagi. - Huh?

85
06:37.196 --> 06:39.736
You already understand the project details.

86
06:39.736 --> 06:42.586
I crammed when I found out I was joining.

87
06:42.586 --> 06:43.876
I see.

88
06:43.876 --> 06:48.196
But you're a huge help, since you've been here longer.

89
06:48.196 --> 06:50.076
I'm not that great.

90
07:21.766 --> 07:23.466
Good work today.

91
07:23.466 --> 07:25.426
You too.

92
07:36.916 --> 07:38.296
So...

93
07:42.236 --> 07:44.716
I heard from Ms. Yamane...

94
07:45.776 --> 07:50.986
that you've been giving her advice.

95
07:52.666 --> 07:57.936
She said she's been relying on you for a long time.

96
07:59.596 --> 08:01.126
She seemed happy.

97
08:04.906 --> 08:06.676
Happy?

98
08:08.836 --> 08:10.416
Yes.

99
08:17.496 --> 08:22.696
I've been with Ms. Yamane ever since she joined the company.

100
08:24.246 --> 08:26.196
She's a really...

101
08:27.976 --> 08:29.856
lovely co-worker.

102
08:33.396 --> 08:34.806
That's why...

103
08:36.056 --> 08:41.106
I was worried you might hurt her when you joined.

104
08:45.346 --> 08:46.806
But...

105
08:48.446 --> 08:50.846
I worried too much.

106
08:53.036 --> 08:56.326
You two have such a nice vibe.

107
08:57.496 --> 09:00.956
When she told me you weren't dating,

108
09:00.956 --> 09:03.706
I was really surprised.

109
09:06.066 --> 09:07.296
Huh?

110
09:08.706 --> 09:11.166
Did we look like a couple?

111
09:15.456 --> 09:16.806
Yeah.

112
09:18.851 --> 09:23.506
There's an application form for that. I'll send it to you later.

113
09:23.506 --> 09:25.366
Thank you.

114
09:34.206 --> 09:36.306
You two make a great pair.

115
09:40.826 --> 09:42.326
Is that so?

116
09:45.816 --> 09:50.676
I didn't know Ms. Ohata thought that way.

117
09:50.676 --> 09:54.406
I was nervous, but she's really nice.

118
10:22.596 --> 10:24.646
I was happy.

119
10:30.176 --> 10:32.226
I actually...

120
10:34.056 --> 10:35.986
remember Kashiwagi.

121
10:38.180 --> 10:39.630
Huh?

122
10:42.056 --> 10:44.726
I lied because I felt uncomfortable.

123
10:50.726 --> 10:52.426
Of course,

124
10:54.086 --> 10:56.966
he didn't do anything wrong, but...

125
10:59.986 --> 11:02.907
[Yamane]

126
11:04.346 --> 11:08.146
I feel like Taguchi has been down lately.

127
11:10.736 --> 11:12.736
Did something happen?

128
11:13.566 --> 11:15.796
I don't know.

129
11:15.796 --> 11:18.706
We haven't really talked properly.

130
11:18.706 --> 11:20.126
I see.

131
11:24.616 --> 11:28.326
I wonder what I can do to be more like a girlfriend.

132
11:29.757 --> 11:31.387
What should you do?

133
11:34.356 --> 11:36.446
A date, maybe.

134
11:36.446 --> 11:37.746
Yeah.

135
11:41.270 --> 11:42.660
Anything else?

136
11:44.070 --> 11:47.870
Anything else? Well...

137
11:51.180 --> 11:53.530
Things that couples do.

138
11:55.480 --> 11:57.990
That's what I need to know.

139
11:58.800 --> 12:02.710
Well... I don't know either.

140
12:02.710 --> 12:05.011
Why not ask AI?

141
12:07.360 --> 12:09.320
AI...

142
12:10.590 --> 12:12.810
What do I even ask?

143
12:14.920 --> 12:17.760
Things that couples do?

144
12:21.290 --> 12:27.970
Did I... do something to make him hate me?

145
12:53.330 --> 12:56.220
"Introduce him to your friends."

146
12:57.780 --> 13:00.750
"Try changing how you call each other."

147
13:06.930 --> 13:09.330
"A date at home."

148
13:13.760 --> 13:15.780
You look so serious.

149
13:16.463 --> 13:19.863
Mr. Taguchi...

150
13:25.330 --> 13:26.550
So, you see...

151
13:26.550 --> 13:28.760
Great.

152
13:28.760 --> 13:31.040
You're here.

153
13:31.040 --> 13:32.710
Ms. Yamane, sorry.

154
13:32.710 --> 13:36.500
I need to ask something about the school for the field test.

155
13:37.410 --> 13:39.100
Are you free now?

156
13:41.030 --> 13:43.490
Yeah, now's fine.

157
13:51.130 --> 13:53.310
Oh, right!

158
13:55.360 --> 13:57.620
Let's all go to dinner.

159
14:11.500 --> 14:14.370
Are you really okay not turning him down?

160
14:16.270 --> 14:17.820
Well, yeah.

161
14:17.820 --> 14:20.710
We can't keep saying no forever.

162
14:24.980 --> 14:27.770
But let's keep our relationship a secret.

163
14:29.450 --> 14:30.730
Okay.

164
14:32.290 --> 14:35.030
I wanna tell him though, honestly.

165
14:35.030 --> 14:38.010
To keep his hands off the girl I care about.

166
14:43.700 --> 14:46.100
Sorry. The restroom was packed.

167
14:46.100 --> 14:47.930
Oh, it's fine.

168
14:50.550 --> 14:53.290
All right then, once again...

169
14:54.740 --> 14:56.910
To our reunion.

170
14:56.910 --> 14:59.410
- Cheers. - Cheers.

171
15:02.390 --> 15:04.270
Thank you for waiting.

172
15:04.270 --> 15:06.460
Thank you.

173
15:09.890 --> 15:12.890
What do you do on your days off?

174
15:13.560 --> 15:18.740
I read books and watch movies.

175
15:18.740 --> 15:20.270
You're still into that?

176
15:20.270 --> 15:21.460
Yeah.

177
15:21.460 --> 15:23.220
I am too.

178
15:23.220 --> 15:26.260
I also play futsal sometimes.

179
15:26.260 --> 15:28.420
Right, you played soccer.

180
15:28.420 --> 15:30.200
Yep, that's right.

181
15:30.890 --> 15:33.060
- And you, Taguchi? - Huh?

182
15:34.690 --> 15:36.880
Taguchi's into books...

183
15:38.475 --> 15:40.225
Or are you?

184
15:41.691 --> 15:45.740
I read sometimes and play games too.

185
15:45.740 --> 15:47.130
I see.

186
15:48.570 --> 15:54.420
It feels refreshing, chatting like this, the three of us.

187
15:55.730 --> 15:58.280
It's like a class reunion.

188
16:00.760 --> 16:03.610
Did you two go to the reunion?

189
16:03.610 --> 16:07.270
Yeah, I went, but left early.

190
16:07.270 --> 16:09.150
Me too.

191
16:09.150 --> 16:13.520
I see... I was late.

192
16:15.170 --> 16:16.960
Did you two meet?

193
16:17.730 --> 16:19.520
No, we didn't meet.

194
16:21.550 --> 16:24.940
So we all haven't met since high school.

195
16:31.300 --> 16:38.060
Actually, we reunited at the class reunion.

196
16:38.060 --> 16:39.860
Huh?

197
16:39.860 --> 16:42.680
Then Taguchi joined the company.

198
16:54.223 --> 16:59.623
And now... we're dating.

199
17:14.760 --> 17:16.620
Kashiwagi?

200
17:23.580 --> 17:25.250
I think...

201
17:27.790 --> 17:29.730
that's really great.

202
17:31.060 --> 17:32.480
Huh?

203
17:33.150 --> 17:34.610
Well...

204
17:35.320 --> 17:37.197
Back in high school,

205
17:37.197 --> 17:41.550
I saw you two together at the summer festival.

206
17:43.440 --> 17:45.860
It was such an unexpected pair...

207
17:45.860 --> 17:49.670
It really struck me.

208
17:52.250 --> 17:53.660
But...

209
17:56.450 --> 18:01.810
Actually, I planned that class reunion.

210
18:05.320 --> 18:10.820
I was hoping you two would reconnect.

211
18:10.820 --> 18:13.970
I guess it wasn't needed since you met at work.

212
18:13.970 --> 18:19.180
No, it mattered. We reunited that day,

213
18:19.180 --> 18:24.940
and that's when I realized Taguchi was special to me.

214
18:27.410 --> 18:29.490
So thank you.

215
18:34.600 --> 18:36.690
I'm so glad.

216
18:43.300 --> 18:44.740
Sorry.

217
18:45.850 --> 18:47.160
Huh?

218
18:48.290 --> 18:49.490
I...

219
18:51.520 --> 18:53.630
do remember you.

220
18:54.968 --> 18:56.518
I...

221
18:58.280 --> 19:01.270
just didn't know what to say at the time.

222
19:04.780 --> 19:06.600
I'm really sorry.

223
19:08.620 --> 19:11.270
It's fine. Don't worry about it at all.

224
19:14.110 --> 19:15.750
Thank you.

225
19:17.940 --> 19:21.940
All right. Let's drink tonight!

226
19:25.402 --> 19:27.942
That was a big surprise today.

227
19:30.150 --> 19:32.310
Did you say it for my sake?

228
19:33.930 --> 19:35.140
Yeah.

229
19:37.590 --> 19:39.310
Are you mad?

230
19:40.160 --> 19:41.620
No.

231
19:44.380 --> 19:46.150
I'm falling for you again.

232
19:49.570 --> 19:51.990
Because you were so cool.

233
19:55.190 --> 19:58.720
No one's ever said that to me before.

234
19:59.710 --> 20:01.110
I see.

235
20:02.910 --> 20:07.370
Hey, I wanted to ask you something.

236
20:07.370 --> 20:08.730
What is it?

237
20:09.400 --> 20:15.390
I've been thinking about where to go for our next date.

238
20:17.250 --> 20:19.180
Thought of anything?

239
20:19.900 --> 20:21.110
Yeah.

240
20:21.110 --> 20:22.530
Where?

241
20:23.630 --> 20:25.750
Your place, Taguchi.

242
20:30.147 --> 20:31.717
My place?

243
20:34.651 --> 20:37.151
It's okay if you don't want to.

244
20:41.930 --> 20:43.140
Then...

245
20:46.705 --> 20:48.205
want to come over now?

246
20:49.270 --> 20:50.530
Now?

247
20:51.570 --> 20:52.790
Yeah.

248
20:56.840 --> 20:58.570
I want you to stay.

249
21:02.596 --> 21:04.406
Coming in.

250
21:16.020 --> 21:17.620
Taguchi...

251
21:20.245 --> 21:22.635
Why are you using my last name?

252
21:25.356 --> 21:26.796
But...

253
21:41.650 --> 21:43.270
Use my first name.

254
21:52.880 --> 21:54.810
Ryosuke.

255
22:19.907 --> 22:21.527
Are you really sure?

256
22:25.470 --> 22:28.010
I won't do anything you don't want.

257
22:37.070 --> 22:38.590
I...

258
22:47.150 --> 22:49.050
I want to...

259
22:50.310 --> 22:52.350
do couple-like things

260
22:54.750 --> 22:56.950
with you, too, Ryosuke.

261
23:30.350 --> 23:34.760
Did we manage to do at least one couple thing?

262
23:34.760 --> 23:36.980
How far do couple things go?

263
23:36.980 --> 23:38.100
Wait a second.

264
23:38.100 --> 23:39.980
If we go further, I won't stop.

265
23:39.980 --> 23:42.330
Your communication skills are amazing.

266
23:42.330 --> 23:43.630
We're going to Sushiro.

267
23:43.630 --> 23:46.530
I'm heading to a meeting with Kashiwagi.

268
23:46.530 --> 23:50.090
I never thought I'd see you make that face.

269
23:50.090 --> 23:52.180
After you transferred schools,

270
23:52.180 --> 23:55.910
Ms. Yamane was really depressed.

271
23:55.910 --> 23:57.875
I can say this now, but...

272
23:58.730 --> 24:00.160
I...

273
24:00.160 --> 24:01.160
MkvDrama.net
